---
import Page from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';

const title = `Getting Started in Business Analytics & Data Science`;
const dateStr = "February 2, 2016";
const content = `<p>Good business analysts are “bilingual” - able to speak fluently to both business managers and IT folks.   Here are a few next steps and concrete resources to dive into analytics and start building expertise:</p>

<p>1. Take a course on analytics, like <a href="http://analytics.loras.edu/business-analytics-certificate-program/">this one from Loras College</a></p>

<p>2. Join the <a href="http://www.iiba.org/About-IIBA.aspx">IIBA</a> and get certified in the Business Analysis Body of Knowledge</p>

<p>3. Read up on better practices, especially books from Stephen Few at http://www.perceptualedge.com and for the fundamentals of information design, I love <a href="http://www.edwardtufte.com/tufte/books_vdqi">Edward Tufte's work</a></p>

<p>4. Play with some tools:<br>
<ul><br>
	<li>IBM Watson <a href="http://www.ibm.com/analytics/watson-analytics/">free trial</a></li><br>
	<li>Tableau <a href="http://www.tableau.com/products/trial">free trial</a></li><br>
	<li>Oracle's new Data Visualization cloud service <a href="https://cloud.oracle.com/data_visualization">free trial</a></li><br>
</ul><br>
5. Join a community of like-minded people:<br>
<ul><br>
	<li><a href="http://www.allanalytics.com/archives.asp?threads=yes">All Analytics</a></li><br>
	<li><a href="https://www.iiba.org/Chapters/United-States.aspx">Your local chapter </a>of the IIBA</li><br>
	<li>A LinkedIn group like <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/60878/profile">this one</a> (with over 150,000 members)</li><br>
</ul></p>`;
---

<Page title={title} description={`Archived blog post from rondimon.com — ${dateStr}`}>

  <section class="container py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl animate-in">
      <a href="/about/archive" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Archive
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-4">{dateStr}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">
        {title}
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl prose-archive" set:html={content} />
  </section>

</Page>
